<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SmartQueue AI</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>SmartQueue AI</h1>
  <p>Reducing wait times using AI-powered predictions</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#problem">Problem</a>
  <a href="#solution">Solution</a>
  <a href="#implementation">Implementation</a>
  <a href="#impact">Impact</a>
  <a href="#ethics">Ethics</a>
</nav>

<section id="problem">
  <h2>Problem</h2>
  <p>Many small businesses struggle with long wait times and poor queue management. Customers often leave due to uncertainty.</p>
  <img src="images/queue.jpg" alt="People waiting in line">
</section>

<section id="solution">
  <h2>AI Solution</h2>
  <p>SmartQueue AI predicts wait times using real-time data like number of customers, service speed, and staff availability.</p>
  <img src="images/ai-diagram.png" alt="AI workflow diagram">
</section>

<section id="implementation">
  <h2>Implementation Plan</h2>
  <p>The system uses JavaScript to simulate AI predictions.</p>

  <div class="calculator">
    <h3>Wait Time Estimator</h3>
    <input type="number" id="people" placeholder="People ahead">
    <input type="number" id="time" placeholder="Avg service time (min)">
    <input type="number" id="staff" placeholder="Staff available">
    <button onclick="calculateWait()">Calculate</button>
    <p id="result"></p>
  </div>

  <img src="images/dashboard.png" alt="Dashboard example">
</section>

<section id="impact">
  <h2>Impact</h2>
  <p>This solution improves customer satisfaction, reduces overcrowding, and helps businesses operate more efficiently.</p>
  <img src="images/shop.jpg" alt="Small business">
</section>

<section id="ethics">
  <h2>Ethics & Challenges</h2>
  <p>Challenges include data privacy, prediction accuracy, and system reliability. AI must be used responsibly.</p>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 SmartQueue AI Project</p>
</footer>

<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

header {
  background: #2c3e50;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px;
}

nav {
  background: #34495e;
  padding: 10px;
  text-align: center;
}

nav a {
  color: white;
  margin: 10px;
  text-decoration: none;
}

section {
  padding: 20px;
}

img {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 500px;
  display: block;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.calculator {
  margin-top: 20px;
}

input {
  display: block;
  margin: 10px 0;
  padding: 8px;
}

button {
  padding: 10px;
  background: #27ae60;
  color: white;
  border: none;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  background: #2c3e50;
  color: white;
  padding: 10px;
}

/* Mobile Friendly */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  nav a {
    display: block;
    margin: 5px;
  }function calculateWait() {
  let people = document.getElementById("people").value;
  let time = document.getElementById("time").value;
  let staff = document.getElementById("staff").value;

  if (people && time && staff) {
    let wait = (people * time) / staff;
    document.getElementById("result").innerText =
      "Estimated Wait Time: " + wait + " minutes";
  } else {
    document.getElementById("result").innerText =
      "Please fill all fields.";
  }
}
}
